---

<div class="cl-tabs__panel" role="tabpanel" id="cl-panel-phenotypes" aria-labelledby="cl-tab-phenotypes" tabindex="0">
  <p class="cl-results__intro">
    Each card is one visible appearance group. Percentages are per conception, shown with two
    decimals; the displayed list uses largest-remainder rounding so it totals exactly 100.00%,
    including any nonviable share. Carrier percentages are in the Genotypes tab.
  </p>
  <div data-nonviable-note></div>
  <div class="cl-results__toolbar">
    <label class="field__label" for="cl-sort">Sort</label>
    <select id="cl-sort" class="cl-gene__select" data-sort>
      <option value="probability">Most likely first</option>
      <option value="name">Name (A–Z)</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <ul class="cl-cards" data-cards></ul>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn--secondary cl-results__more" data-show-more hidden>Show more</button>
</div>
